{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1330,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:875928b41ff9cc443a25b790",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼，每个人的表情都不赖嘛！\r\n虽然还是完～全\r\n赢不过风风啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b4daa5aea5f75969b3a0529d502e7ec3e9e457a89e0ce7cb4de49eff1945e7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2eb216f70515762e902ad31f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，手下！\r\n仔细看着老大的跑姿啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be8142d480c0326cb206256810d441d227563bae8778855d5e262bae8d95b299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce66b0e8f8e51e6e91c3b9d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一口气深深咬下！\r\n要在比赛中留下咬痕喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48888689b69df770b39ad02ede9852e6a449ada08957571a5b4bca5079b07e3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:796b796ff0190e110ab6ce9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妈妈说她会看转播！\r\n风风要超～级吸睛喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f39d733a87142a143c52450c4b0d04e9b4b778d4e105d0a13809c13388680d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:359484ac6b0fe8ef638983e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～？总觉得哪里怪怪的耶。\r\n风风明明把牙齿刷干净了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ed1614cb3de2254c94748701e728ffc3a0d63b8702d373083a56163861c06b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:499dd8cbad7efcf7f4ac626b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风风想快点去比赛啦～！\r\n风风觉得无聊了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c64a941aa83f6aaef39feb1f684d2a2176274d23cd98aceba8c98f0814e9f717",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42d2d2d0d34f4e11b8f83b21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好没劲～对了！\r\n训练员，你自己下去跑\r\n应该会更有趣喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b0c284edc05e46c843c46372e9c889cd614557f92b76d0bc95e57b9bc888d9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42d765677d7d8da21a50b44a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论遇到什么危机风风都不会退缩！\r\n不坚持到最后一个步骤\r\n就不叫恶作剧了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "958d45ebf0e33b305368a0048d8b9daf7531f6f5b8cea27219b447fa1fe69a43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0341fca54f6f365d430bb401",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……风风……\r\n是、最强……的喔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f035b04c16b068ed19d4bbee941c5ee355c0d07ddb3d223b02b0de977fa415d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c649feb68805b8eb55e8d6d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风风不想就这样结束！\r\n大家……大家，快点……\r\n看过来啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e56f89608331fad33f41d104cbe146ad28dcec7b453895db4b067bc0119cefd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10b3d7c457c1561530de7d92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哒哒──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b0fd0e823b631eab22caf2344ad0563fc84f860cc85f807430441c05bf1c47d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97d84c459a9bc4a455d70017",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吼──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff1bf19c4d41be675008eba348de111ecda8a4852b247ac305c2f0b2c3a7a4ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e38a31e8e8ae941a818f53c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做就对了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2d31962fa2b64977e9016466ad7825c54e72650061f563f7b5d4a3722f6807f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1daa17e8019e2b41048ac7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "念、念书……",
      "source_fingerprint": "597ceda1fc716da72e2b7e8f3a25f57170fd3eb8872793d131298b3ec19194e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09e6ae74c74fe18c80200331",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇──！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2b3a8cbd9e9924b0a2863b0bb78dd8450667bb48fd440e1802583b95918d7bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b70da20b3895eecf5730d72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔啊啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1edd9d63b48c4d8245b822f3f735b139f7852b078f7dee2563d3d9bc4f6d477",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:572b37dd7416d6158e2d09ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟风风来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee90cf9d3e78522ad2c402c8c8bb3b71bd8b3523f88d6ebd3674fda2001510e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b76ed35aaab601cdea78eb90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": " 啪唰──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75441c5b7abe27d584573be4e410633843ef4036ce8b8d28a8a6a8d29afa6687",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3386502adf8f715fdc14b55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以你的程度来说算是做得不错了喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a0f5c8b5184b4bf8a97684a45af32f92dee42eddda513f0d93919245f91e4b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f76c2a58c6eca3a4fde10ab1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑得还算开心啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5adb1831e92451470583fd10f479c35e3a24b63dc470db160b223694450a48de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03dfa46b9228704ec8f6f3bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟上风风我的脚步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4231f25f0ef215435c6aeefef45463e6f09278fb4a0d80e969fbcfe62e3f6178",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a26fc410e88c027c44f453fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一口气向前咬！",
      "source_fingerprint": "daf544a0feaa093887ac76c224c71b25778a97997c516210b64839e9149ba907",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b310180dbacaf6600816017b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "手下们，上啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39a82c038323f87273503ac1e44aa0af9cf3da920803b66bd719ed8b3f88db59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9effb560e35fdde54c8755ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑得还算开心啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5adb1831e92451470583fd10f479c35e3a24b63dc470db160b223694450a48de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9403f497f1cc6749315679fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼，每个人的表情都不赖嘛！\r\n虽然还是完～全\r\n赢不过风风啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b4daa5aea5f75969b3a0529d502e7ec3e9e457a89e0ce7cb4de49eff1945e7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeb20f77e227f329383c2382",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天风风也要\r\n独占所有人的注意喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49b9ad528a5a49635cd3c6066a44ee387aa50f6424ed04e6d90717427f95d04e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a19ea8bcde64f11d7f878935",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑得还算开心啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5adb1831e92451470583fd10f479c35e3a24b63dc470db160b223694450a48de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3959b0bf6cab395f5a4db6cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やるのだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff6d5503acab0632f194ada06ce54a0d1fbb6a9f48c50e1acc6ecd4d931b2ff1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2df452c4216ba04f8ad7dc51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要一口气得第一名喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca92404337cfbb6741da918fb6ad1cba5894bf69600bc6f367182ed87587564f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4ebfd5d8a32bc34cacb8963",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把脖子洗干净等着吧～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d94da4eea17c1a1961d467091dc68d5e220cb87a55c2883860326e2fc029b75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cceb2b771de1a9172ed9f0e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也看向风风吧～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc65412f2dccb488aec9d49dd441fc485adb10fd6b21e5cf1736ea4d27147665",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12fc8c753597295a33c1e023",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还想再来一次啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "621704584edb0c1a5872606773aa2aaea3dc09e82d0cde784dab0176c3c2b91f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fab88d0ae034794fa5543470",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下一个想被咬碎的……\r\n是谁啊？吼──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f41ceeb27a61f230bdeeef1668d14ffbd2542788dbfc4b40ada3a8ddd6b3a2f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daca93d7fc2c52eecb55ef3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到了吗？看到了吧！风风赢了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63b1b8308054c206ed376c597a46d7752cd23f73eec6d1270f439a8e9d986d8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33e959e3b01be62b65a21450",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在那里等着风风吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9786e91ad823dbb6a47c420b84406c2b7f4c6db6adcd80976ad3d6b50c6b0827",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a96cb9921a624cd8d98d0556",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吼吼吼吼……看风风大口咬！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b31d4d342e530f28566aaabac8f80878be1b1c7a077aa86b29b2249cd0a33c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:603222ecba1f7ff820a12938",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家一起盖出一座\r\n用来崇拜风风的\r\n最强魔王城堡吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc21a3c176c503680cc64cd4d85ac2967495cf9a1c522435a140b423fb030427",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3fe4399c7d7b7487d4565b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然能聚集到这么多仆人……\r\n太强了……太强了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71fdd63a9f8da4a7e0e8f66949977174543d996cadcbd1b4d572dd15ae5b46a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c417b694066e4da275ca3f0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然风风是大坏蛋，\r\n但觉得偶尔出手跟伙伴\r\n同心协力也不错喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9373c0257931c4db0b7610698e2e0c781cfde743a919aa1415e4b5438ff22313",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c47f7cd460fc16f1f874c34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘻嘻嘻……唔？哇哈哈！那家伙！\r\n这家伙！全都赢不过风风喔──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "721b742a25f5bc8a3baa3dab1d789e5759bc5e9083e132f9642bea7362e7c22f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2185801550cfa3001b7d0071",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动任务？\r\n风风搞不太懂，\r\n就派你去看看是怎么回事吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44d47ac83a9686f03fd45883c6073738de31e89ccf6f48e66572c726ed0dc0f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:267e70387070aa17b325997e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没忘记东西吧？\r\n能拿的东西就要全都拿走！\r\n这就是坏蛋的规矩喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8b0ed0da609cd3d8aea9157be7fc057ef87b64e1626733159dbf0345ceb3562",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11c06736cd59e8986015370c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紧紧咬着，走着瞧吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6dfe53d67c3aae311dcec55e9aa5b2300fa610718f34d39de8a45923410f76b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc03e778d837dc86f41d6ed7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "会发光的那个！要用力挥喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2beede85a88a79f22357bdeaa316ea03ed5066b5c4626b9fbf2202746e8ab93d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1afc0cf44d2f5b5ed3038e7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吼──！不理我我就咬人喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a62012cf54dfab8c8187cc4f0d3a6069b8c705c533a82b15679ac64e73ea9db6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb4905b8621c50ce2419862",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是风风好心才选了\r\n你这软弱的家伙！\r\n还不感谢风风！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2695be1e1fd5943b1dbfbd6de18389cd56f178f90518de5519a0efc55bbb217f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
