        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a387a58f45188b99c5684cb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做得很好喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c92cc7b3980b6710cc2176779fe416a54b3d191b4f3723cd2807d4496a5c7a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b84bcfe88d459b1689446b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一大早就来见老大啊？\r\n很棒很棒！挺有心的喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34dbe9a8dd2fc65c48dfc73e68eb5a63e577383e91a0faf027077e9a2deb0592",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cfb62b061682d44518c6b1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员看起来好困……\r\n嘻嘻嘻，如果趁现在咬他一口\r\n一定会很有趣喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e3c9d249e83d6ea0526fbf5260fe0d42c4cac800c48c3037f9bc5988ed7cfff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbf86ccfc2dec0ef8243960d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃玉米的时间到了喔！\r\n走啰！来去跟食堂的阿姨\r\n讨玉米啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b814930aa7f1e782da415fbd8b59cd3800332fdd9489a57c8c5f1dc71b2a0b41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bfd1c5f3a53587ad054dcbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午休时间……该午睡了……\r\n但是……风风也好想……\r\n恶作剧喔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f451971b795a8f0a1ab3fc4e871dc0f601ad0f754c908021d51765c830e904ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4668ee4159a3d47c8f94c697",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来得好！\r\n一起去准备明天的恶作剧吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6b0be255159640d27b636d95d8c24ed2222104a3f6c2df5c481071e35dc3315",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5b8c1190f95e37926b0b2ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊～～唔！？\r\n刚、刚刚那是……对！是在嚎叫喔！\r\n绝对不是傻傻地打呵欠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb65b9ff3292ff9edf2b6bca570bd75c824db6655f275470310e5df643c6c185",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b88cc43bb9416a75eb85a6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好期待喔！选定新猎物的季节到了！\r\n先来试咬一口试试看口感吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca43e0f55177e9f36e4ca3e924331ba927def1f5a1b92721d25081edca7022da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7988d4c11259628b71d4bc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，出发去抓独角仙啰！\r\n风风要抓只最大最强的收为手下啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8184f08d42b452a762be64fccf3fb1cc746076eb4337d1cb5026fc800d40b62e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2df4c90877982c96f0a1257",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "栗子！烤番薯！南瓜！\r\n风风全～都超喜欢！\r\n秋天根本是天堂啊～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f53738d9a8a70381903c9e92d1bddb66e6a5abe434ef172c884a486a4cad69e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d30901a3b045f05f4ae398d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好期待！好期待！\r\n喂，快去看看积雪了没吧！\r\n风风要打雪仗！做雪屋！做雪人～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c18742ee7f21ad47c447c7b6790f31f785d7b768163d9253106dbfde1e32f93f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c54f06ab6b5f0d815f92e104",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:933ebcf2f361437917fe7732",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气槽那家伙，每次风风只要\r\n一做什么就会追上来喔。\r\n噗呵呵，今天该玩些什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "59af1b01fabfd13852571a8a03aae6ab6eab6ca65d8bf9a72512fa7679ff26fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21d26d194ad80c8ed59462d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妈妈寄了新牙刷给风风，\r\n叫风风「好好加油」喔！\r\n风风要好好刷牙！嘻嘻嘻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c11f2db07ed23a878abceff05c3cf8aa616bff77739d80097315652da946e67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebee4bc34778b2531a1dc21a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "I am Windy！Yes～前进！哼哼♪\r\n有采珠前辈陪风风练习用英文对话，\r\n风风随时都能咬向世界了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4bade5e58df09f169954dfda1efba6acdd5ae1f68b0d74912417b823b4a77e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1986ef811a75679ac4953fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚风风好像听到谁在说\r\n「口水直流」……？快把风风藏好！\r\n风风不想跟怪人说话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a22f4bc4576a4ddc0efdaf1e64c1ea2ab0fc542da6fc270edbab7be0c4b707c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "91003"
      ]
    }
  ]
